+/// then `Foo` has alignment 4 as well. Here is the smallest possible value for
+/// `Foo`:
+///
+/// ```text
+/// byte offset | 01234567
+///       field | aaaab---
+///                    ><
+/// ```
+///
+/// In this value, `z` has length 0. Abiding by `#[repr(C)]`, the lowest offset
