+        // Asserts that `$ty` implements any `$trait` and doesn't implement any
+        // `!$trait`. Note that all `$trait`s must come before any `!$trait`s.
+        //
+        // For `T: TryFromBytes`, uses `TryFromBytesTestable` to test success
